# tests/

Unit tests for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Powered by `jest-expo` + `@testing-library/
react-native`.

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`unit/`](unit/) | Unit tests — pure modules and small components. |

## Conventions

- One test file per module: `homeHeader.test.tsx`, `storage.test.ts`.
- Tests live alongside the source path under `tests/unit/<mirror>/...` or
  use the colocated `*.test.tsx` pattern next to the source — pick one and
  stay consistent.
- Use `@testing-library/react-native`'s `render` + `screen.getByText`,
  `screen.getByRole` for component tests.

## Running

```bash
npm test
```

